<section class="section" id="storm-guide">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div><div class="kicker" data-i18n="hurr_kicker">Storm guide</div><h2 data-i18n="hurr_h1">Hurricane season<br>checklist.</h2></div>
    <p data-i18n="hurr_desc">June–November in an HVHZ zone demands preparation. Here is what Florida City homes need — and who does each job.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="check-grid">
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">1</span><span data-i18n="hurr1_t">Roof inspection</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr1_p">Loose tiles, sealing and drip edge — required by the 2026 code.</p></div>
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">2</span><span data-i18n="hurr2_t">Gutter cleaning</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr2_p">Prevent flooding around the foundation.</p></div>
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">3</span><span data-i18n="hurr3_t">Tree trimming</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr3_p">Reduce falling-branch damage risk.</p></div>
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">4</span><span data-i18n="hurr4_t">Impact windows or shutters</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr4_p">Miami-Dade NOA or Florida Product Approval required.</p></div>
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">5</span><span data-i18n="hurr5_t">Emergency generator</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr5_p">Professional install by a licensed electrician.</p></div>
    <div class="check reveal"><b><span class="n">6</span><span data-i18n="hurr6_t">Drainage & pumps</span></b><p data-i18n="hurr6_p">Stop flooding before it starts.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="warn reveal">
    <div><b data-i18n="hurr_warn_t">After a storm, beware unlicensed contractors.</b><p data-i18n="hurr_warn_p">Always check the license at MyFloridaLicense.com before hiring.</p></div>
    <a class="btn primary" href="#contact" data-track="storm_cta"><span data-i18n="hurr_cta">Get storm-ready</span> &uarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .check-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 16px }
  .check { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 22px; background: #080a0d }
  .check b { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 17px }
  .check .n { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px;
    background: rgba(227,6,47,.14); border: 1px solid rgba(227,6,47,.45); color: #fff }
  .check p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 10px 0 0 }
  .warn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-top: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(227,6,47,.4); border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(227,6,47,.12),transparent 60%) }
  .warn b { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 19px }
  .warn p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 6px 0 0 }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .check-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr }
    .warn { flex-direction: column; align-items: start }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .check-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
  }
</style>
